url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T03:32:43Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T03:32:43Z","body":"> Marking as draft as #99883 / #91401 show that there are still issues with mismatching builtin and vendored libs for the text stack (freetype, icu4c, etc.).\r\n\r\nIs it feasible or desirable to temporarily disable the option of system-provided `harfbuzz` to get this merged?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2557976779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578667608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100052#issuecomment-2578667608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100052","id":2578667608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zs1hY","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T21:05:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T21:05:58Z","body":"I think we can merge this for now, but we'll have to look into #91401 and #100301 to validate how safe the options we provide to use system libraries are.\r\n\r\n> Is it feasible or desirable to temporarily disable the option of system-provided `harfbuzz` to get this merged?\r\n\r\nI suppose you meant `icu4c`? Or did you also find system provided `harfbuzz` to cause issues independently?\r\n\r\n@bruvzg mentioned there would be issues with system-provided icu4c if the icu data doesn't match, so we might indeed want to remove that option for the time being, so Linux distros don't step into that mess.\r\n\r\nWould that effectively work around #91401 and #100301 in a satisfactory way?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578667608/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578686382","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100052#issuecomment-2578686382","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100052","id":2578686382,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zs6Gu","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T21:17:39Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T21:17:39Z","body":"> mentioned there would be issues with system-provided icu4c if the icu data doesn't match, so we might indeed want to remove that option for the time being, so Linux distros don't step into that mess.\r\n\r\nIt should not be an issue with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100104 merged, since data is now part of the template and editor can use different version of ICU.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578686382/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578874180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100052#issuecomment-2578874180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100052","id":2578874180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ztn9E","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T23:29:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T23:29:42Z","body":"I added a warning about #91401 and #100301 (which I could confirm) in cases where either harfbuzz or icu4c are system-provided (those two seem to cause issues, the rest seems fine at least for the linked bug reports).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578874180/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2579623744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100052#issuecomment-2579623744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100052","id":2579623744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zwe9A","user":{"login":"j20001970","id":71766835,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzY2ODM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71766835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970","html_url":"https://github.com/j20001970","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/st